    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this attractive 3 bedroom semi-detached family home, extending to approximately 112 sq.m & situated in a popular residential area within easy walking distance of Ballinamore town centre. Built in 2005, this well-proportioned property offers comfortable accommodation and an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those seeking a convenient home close to local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen/dining room, guest WC, family bathroom and three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a BER rating of C and enjoys a convenient location close to the wide range of shops, schools, services and recreational amenities available in Ballinamore.\r\n\r\nOffering comfortable accommodation in a well-established residential setting, this property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a home within easy reach of the town centre and all local amenities.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
      },
      {
